app
  ctrl+c  ^c  quit  on
  ?       ?   help  on

filter
  up shift+tab  ↑          previous field  on
  down tab      ↑↓         field           on
  left          ←          previous        on
  right         ←→         choose          on
  space         space      choose          on
  enter         ↵          edit            on
  x backspace   x          remove          on
  enter         ↵          apply           off
  r             r          reset           on
  esc           esc        cancel          on
  ]             ]          next tab        on
  [             [          previous tab    on
  up ctrl+p     ↑/ctrl+p   up              off
  down ctrl+n   ↓/ctrl+n   down            off
  pgup          pgup       page up         off
  pgdown        pgdn       page down       off
  enter         enter      open            off
  esc           esc        close           off
  tab           tab        scope           off
  shift+tab     shift+tab  previous scope  off
